+# Principal review of PR #1352: V3 lexical interface retained, language transfer still open
+
+September 23, 2026. Reviewed PR head `3aa2f4784af63fa0c4dad4856a1f488c5b5c5988` against protected base `6ae7625ffa11e86eeb176e45e22d6fef609b8ac6`, the [submitted result](transferable-lexical-result-2026-09-22.md), source, sealed roots, prior [lexical review](state-conditioned-lexical-review-2026-09-22.md), and the [independent checks](../evidence/transferable-lexical-principal-checks-2026-09-23.json). Live GitHub owns protected delivery. The original V3 artifacts and exposed roots remain preserved.
+
+## Decision
+
+Retain V3 as a meaningful **observation and feedback interface repair**. The exported ternary recurrent state now receives the actual emitted token's fitted row and a typed causal block; the learned policy emits a word after completing an exact owned copy and chooses Stop. The source and 31 loaded normal rows support that component. This does **not** finish transferable lexical learning. The next milestone is one shared open-vocabulary Generate/Copy/Stop continuation path, with source-separated ordinary-text learning and grounded exact-span responses through the same native session. Broader conversation and executed Rust follow useful lexical transfer.
+
+## Evidence and exposure
+
+The submitted roots `state-lexical-v3-8` and `state-lexical-v3-10` each list 24 files. Independent inspection found no missing or unlisted files; listed sizes and BLAKE3 digests match. The five artifact files are byte-identical between roots. The final root's three source SHA256s match the submitted PR, and its recorded executable hash matches the retained release binary. Root 10 is an **exposed replay** of the same learned artifact and panel, not a fresh draw.
+
+The 155 saved case rows contain 31 per arm: LegacyWords, retained finite table, V3 normal, context disabled, and recurrence disabled. V3 scores **31/31** (23 fitting cases, eight cases from three other documents). The eight other cases are current/previous/initial requests using familiar answer forms; **none is a computation or a new relation form**. All computed and post-copy `now` cases are fitted. Teacher-forced **791/791** checks export/reload on 122 training sequences, not unseen language. All ten cross-process child continuations match full remaining effects and final sessions. The finite table scores 20/31 but lacks V3's content, typed block and token state; it is not an equal-information measure of recurrent or geometric advantage.
+
+The code executes fitted emitted-token rows in the recurrence. All unfamiliar copied tokens use one reserved OOV row. For equal-length unfamiliar copies with the same typed facts and action symbols, the state trajectory is identical. The content view retains early positions and a final token but can still discard the middle of a long span. The exact selected-versus-operand comparison distinguishes arbitrary unfamiliar **equality**, not arbitrary unfamiliar token identities or semantics. A loaded representation distinction is a precondition for language learning, not evidence of its use in an answer.
+
+The reported **4/4** paired computed requests change operation and the supplied `key_changed` bit along with payload. They prove that those fitted requests yield different outputs and recurrent states; they do **not** isolate a payload-content effect with request and typed facts held fixed. A unit test originally named as a content-only test has the same confound and is renamed to its actual fitted-case scope. The readout receives typed facts directly as well as through the recurrence. Recurrence-disabled 0/31 shows the whole recurrent mechanism matters on this fixture, but cannot assign the post-copy decision to copied-token identity. The post-copy action is genuinely selected by the exported policy without a structural override on the saved normal cases; its target is the same authored `now` for every changed-key case.
+
+The target renderer maps a **derived key change** to `it became {value} now`. Following a different address does not commit a new version of the entity. In the saved run, a computed Ivo answer can say `it became Alma now` without an Ivo mutation. The runner's `committed` fact means a previous assertion exists at the captured address; it is not an operation-commit event. Preserve the target as an authored route marker. Independent meaning tests must separate changed address with equal returned value, unchanged address with different returned value, and an actual committed correction before claiming truthful temporal wording.
+
+The E prior and S query policy are present at pinned hashes. The submitted probe loaded both but generated with E alone; constructing `QueryHard` was not an S read. The principal replay executes the S checked inference path and records its rows and continuation separately. Neither component owns the scoped copy span, and this is a component assessment rather than a matched language-quality comparison. Ordinary project prose is measured as only about 2% represented by the fitted content rows. **Ordinary-text learning remains NOT_RUN.** The eight generated vocabulary slots are authored, and no complete-path energy or geometric superiority is measured.
+
+## First-principles architectural direction
+
+The current data do not train a semantic dependency that asks the learner to choose different uncopied words for distinct copied payloads under the same typed facts. Widening a representation or adding epochs cannot establish that absent dependency. The next experiment needs a real text objective and one controlled grounded contrast in which the correct post-copy decision depends on source content while request, copy length and typed facts are held fixed. Exact addresses/version provenance remain external ownership. A learned state should receive enough actual token information to choose vocabulary and Stop; an owned span should be copied exactly and its emitted tokens fed back. Compare against a competent same-information low-bit recurrent or finite baseline before attributing a quality gain to geometric transport.
+
+The architectural mechanism choice is open. Signed ordered H4 transport and the shared contextual residual are promising candidates when role/order or context collision becomes a measured limit. A finite harmonic bank or S7/Hopf/E8 representation needs a witnessed interference/capacity/cost advantage; orthogonality alone does not preserve an unbounded number of live language relations. D0-b allows low-bit additive maps at serving, so the current ternary RNN is an admissible baseline while dense parameter traffic remains a cost to measure. No quantum or geometric performance claim follows from this panel.
+
+Primary research checked for this direction: [CopyNet](https://aclanthology.org/P16-1154/) motivates joint vocabulary and exact copying; [recurrent language models as finite-state automata](https://aclanthology.org/2023.emnlp-main.502/) sharpens state/string-distribution questions; [Scalable MatMul-free Language Modeling](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.02528v7) supports low-bit recurrent feasibility without transferring its energy figures; and [A Hippocampus for Linear Attention](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.02303) studies exact associations beside compressed state, without validating UOR-R4.
+
+The [next DeepSeek brief](deepseek-ordinary-lexical-step-2026-09-23.md) completes this single open milestone. Keep the source/evidence distinctions above as the preflight, then train and assess ordinary continuation and grounded copying in one coherent run. Necessary local time/storage extensions remain standing-authorized when recorded prospectively; they are not arbitrary stopping gates. Preserve all failed and positive roots and use protected delivery.
